2.1.0 2026-10-24
  -   - Converted the 108 EEG recordings from EEGLAB .set and .fdt to BDF   - Updated the EEG file names in the scans.tsv files to the BDF files   - Moved the FacePerception events files beside the EEG and MEG runs   - Added a RecordingDuration sidecar for each EEG run and a task-level EEG sidecar   - Added the sample column to the events sidecar   - Added the empty-room row to participants.tsv   - Converted the electrode coordinates from centimetres to millimetres   - Documented the nose direction as +Y in the coordinate system files, and added coordinate system files for sub-005 and sub-016   - Set HEDVersion to 8.5.0   - Regrouped repeated HED tags with curly braces in the events sidecar (no tags added or removed)   - Keyed the value and button_press levels by their codes, corrected the descriptions of value levels 1 to 4, and added levels for the codes 4, 101, and 102   - Set SoftwareFilters to n/a for EEG and for the empty-room MEG sidecar   - Added MEG sidecars for sub-005 and sub-016, with AssociatedEmptyRoom absent   - Set MiscChannelCount to 13 and SoftwareFilters to GradientOrder 0 in the MEG sidecars, as in ds000117
